se shell syntax, SSTI, SSRF, LFI). |\\n| `web_attack` | Web Attack Surface | Probes target URLs for exposed files (`.env`, `.git`) and audits HTTP security headers. |\\n| `post_exploit` | Post-Exploitation Audit | SUID/SGID checks, persistence mechanisms, and Active Directory lateral movement auditing. |\"","StartLine":"96","TargetContent":"\"**Final loss: 0.82** — healthy convergence with no overfitting. Trained in 82 seconds on a Tesla T4.\\n\\n---\"","TargetFile":"\"c:\\\\Users\\\\k4ran\\\\OneDrive\\\\Desktop\\\\smartAGENT\\\\docs\\\\benchmarks.md\"","toolAction":"\"Updating docs/benchmarks.md\"","toolSummary":"\"Update docs/benchmarks.md\""}}]}
